     "<div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em\">I’m currently trying to use the <span style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">enrich</span> function to run a multivariable S-LDSC analysis for a model that includes multiple latent factors. Running <span style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">s_ldsc</span> works fine, but when I run the <span style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">enrich</span> function I get the following error:</p>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block\">Error in GenomicSEM::enrich(s_covstruc = s_ldsc_res_baseline, model = insulin_model_resid,  : \r\n  object &#39;bread&#39; not found\r\n</span></span><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em\">My model and <span style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">enrich</span> code are below:</p>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block\">insulin_model_resid &lt;-   c(&#39;F_GLY =~ FG + A1C + GLU + DM_RET + DM_NEPH + DM_NEUR\r\n                       F_nonGLY =~ DM_RET + DM_NEPH + DM_NEUR\r\n                       F_INS =~ FI + DM_RET + DM_NEPH + DM_NEUR\r\n\r\n                       F_GLY~~NA*F_GLY\r\n                       F_nonGLY~~NA*F_nonGLY\r\n                       F_INS~~NA*F_INS\r\n                       F_GLY~~0*F_nonGLY\r\n                       F_GLY~~0*F_INS\r\n                       F_nonGLY~~0*F_INS\r\n                      &#39;)\r\n\r\nbaseline_enrich &lt;- GenomicSEM::enrich(\r\n               s_covstruc = s_ldsc_res_baseline,\r\n               model = insulin_model_resid, \r\n               params = &quot;F_nonGLY~~F_nonGLY&quot;, \r\n               <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237411318000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GVC_5cA90lVZqFv5YDd00\">std.lv</a> = TRUE\r\n             )\r\n</span></span><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em\">Any ideas about how I may be able to address the <span style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">&#39;bread&#39; not found</span> error?</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj5JJ20gY3VycmVudGx5IHRyeWluZyB0byB1c2UgdGhlIGBlbnJpY2hgIGZ1bmN0aW9uIHRv\nIHJ1biBhIG11bHRpdmFyaWFibGUgUy1MRFNDIGFuYWx5c2lzIGZvciBhIG1vZGVsIHRoYXQgaW5j\nbHVkZXMgbXVsdGlwbGUgbGF0ZW50IGZhY3RvcnMuIFJ1bm5pbmcgYHNfbGRzY2Agd29ya3MgZmlu\nZSwgYnV0IHdoZW4gSSBydW4gdGhlIGBlbnJpY2hgIGZ1bmN0aW9uIEkgZ2V0IHRoZSBmb2xsb3dp\nbmcgZXJyb3I6PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl